	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "PM module mount, module side (docs/pm-interface.md): four M2 screws (1 VIN, 2 GND input end, 3 GND output end, 4 VOUT; 2 and 3 offset 2 mm inward, polarised) through 2.4 mm plated holes into SMT standoffs on the host. Head pad 5.0 mm on top, 6.2 mm standoff face pad underneath (5.56 mm body), ring of 8 vias. Aux pads: PM_Aux_Pads_2x03 at (+12.70, -7.85).")
